  you are strong if you do not you are  weak this takes on a disturbing element  when you consider how many superheroes  have a superpower that essentially  amounts to opulent wealth or a wealthy  benefactor Batman  man iron man green arrow iron fist and  how many real people believe that wealth  is strength and strength is the right to  rule so thanks it's a great question I  love to talk about the ethics and  morality of superheroes it's nice  because they're fake no one really has  laser vision so it's a disarmed slightly  distant sort of way to discuss real  world problems power how we relate to it  in a broad metaphorical sense and that's  the strength of stories and you can let  me know what you think in the comments  and as always if you've got a question  you could submit it through ask fm or  contact me on Twitter now go in peace my  children in the name of like share and  subscribe  amen
 

